rights in them. The terms of the generator that made the drawings apply to its output.

This file lists everything in Half Lid that comes from somewhere else.


AGENT LOGOS
===========

Half Lid shows the logo of each coding agent it can watch, next to the agent's name, only to say which agent a row is about.
The logos are small SVG files in Resources/agent-marks. The first lines of each file say where it came from.

