TRADEMARKS
==========

Cursor, Claude, Claude Code, Codex, OpenAI, opencode, GitHub, GitHub Copilot and Goose, and their logos, are trademarks or
registered trademarks of their respective owners. An open license on a drawing of a logo does not give anyone rights over
the trademark itself.

Half Lid is an independent project. It is not affiliated with, endorsed by or sponsored by any of those companies or
projects. Their names and logos appear only to identify the program a row refers to.

If an owner objects to the use of a logo, delete its file from Resources/agent-marks (in the app: right-click Half Lid.app,
Show Package Contents, Contents/Resources/agent-marks). Half Lid then shows that agent with the icon of the application,
when it is installed, or with the first letter of its name. Nothing else changes.


NO OTHER DEPENDENCIES
=====================

Half Lid is written in Swift and uses only the frameworks that ship with macOS (AppKit, SwiftUI, IOKit, UserNotifications,
ServiceManagement and the system SQLite library). It bundles no other code and downloads nothing.
